---
description: Room database conventions for AndroidBase
globs: app/src/main/java/com/kira/android_base/app/data/local/db/**/*.kt
alwaysApply: false
---

# Room + Local DB
- Update `AppDatabase` entities list and version when adding new `@Entity`.
- Update `DatabaseModule` to provide the new DAO(s) from the database.
- Keep `@Entity` models mapping-friendly (prefer `fun toDomain()` like `UserEntity.toUser()`).
- Prefer DAO patterns:
  - `Flow<T>` for query observations
  - `suspend` for insert/delete operations

